# Project Report

## UAV Tracking System with Kalman Filter & Obstacle Detection

### Objective
Combine GPS-based UAV tracking, ultrasonic obstacle detection, and Kalman-filtered position estimation.

### Modules
- C8051 embedded controller
- GPS position acquisition
- Ultrasonic proximity sensing
- Kalman position filtering
- Python trajectory visualization

### Data Flow
```text
GPS + Ultrasonic
       ↓
     C8051
       ↓
Sensor/Telemetry Data
       ↓
Python
       ↓
Kalman Filter
       ↓
Position Estimate
       ↓
Trajectory Visualization
```

> This report describes the reconstructed repository implementation. Hardware-specific GPIO mappings, timer configuration, UART settings, and measured experimental values should be updated to match the actual setup.
